	(descr "Bourns 3362P, 1/4 inch square Trimpot, single-turn cermet, top adjust, THT, 3 leads IN-LINE on 2.54 mm centres. Hand-authored from the Bourns 3362 datasheet (REV 06/20) because KiCad 10 ships no 3362 land pattern, and every 3362-adjacent footprint in Potentiometer_THT (3386/3266/3296) is a different body with a triangular pin pattern this part does not have. Body 6.60 x 6.99 mm, leads 0.46 +/- 0.03 mm dia. Terminal 2 is the wiper. See docs/boards/l1-05-internal-adc/starter-pack.md for what is datasheet-exact here and what is inferred.")
